# FOAM mobile testing expectations

Every native feature must consider at minimum:

1. Normal success path  
2. Loading state  
3. Empty state  
4. Error state  
5. Slow network  
6. Offline network  
7. Reconnect  
8. Permission denied  
9. Permission permanently denied  
10. App backgrounded  
11. App killed and reopened  
12. Duplicate taps  
13. Request timeout  
14. Firebase failure  
15. Upload failure  
16. Retry  
17. Recovery after retry  

## Driver workflows — also consider

- GPS unavailable / location permission denied
- Camera permission denied / camera unavailable
- Photo upload interrupted
- Order status update interrupted / duplicate status update
- Stale order data
- Another device changing the same order

## Devices

Testing must eventually include Android emulator, physical Android, iOS simulator, and physical iPhone.

Do **not** claim mobile functionality is production-ready based only on a browser preview.
